  "id": "07d0a50e-8678-4893-b488-51af7fd48625",
  "title": "Add Hash, Sub, Neg impls to Gf2mElement",
  "description": "Add missing trait implementations to Gf2mElement required for FiniteField conformance:\n\n- `Hash`: hash only `self.value` (field identity is a precondition enforced by Arc::ptr_eq at arithmetic time, not part of the hash).\n- `Sub for Gf2mElement` and `Sub for &Gf2mElement`: delegate to Add (characteristic 2: subtraction = addition = XOR).\n- `Neg for Gf2mElement` and `Neg for &Gf2mElement`: return self.clone() (characteristic 2: negation is identity).\n\nThese are prerequisites for implementing FiniteField on Gf2mElement.\n\nLocation: crates/gf2-core/src/gf2m/field.rs",
